  "_slots": "25 empty slots, release-01 to release-25. To fill one: (1) type the title, (2) set type to single, ep or album, (3) add releaseDate as YYYY-MM-DD, (4) paste the platform links that exist and leave the rest empty, (5) save the cover art as the file named in cover (change .jpg to .png in the cover path if needed). A slot with an empty title is not shown on the page, so unused slots can stay. Slot order does not matter, the page sorts by releaseDate (newest first). Need more slots? Copy any slot block. Need another platform? Add its key from data/platforms.json to links."
